<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Warrior Tank in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Raid. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Blackrock Caverns, Throne of the Tides, The Stonecore, Vortex Pinnacle, Lost City of the Tol’vir, Halls of Origination, Grim Batol, Deadmines, Shadowfang Keep. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c1">Best in Slot Gear for Protection Warrior Tank Pre-Raid</span></h2>Starting from <b>Cataclysm</b>, gearing as a tank changes a lot <i>(and also becomes a bit dull, sadly)</i>.<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Your primary stats (<b>Strength</b> and <b>Stamina</b>) as well as <b>Armor</b> now scale linearly based on the item level of each item and you are constrained to use only plate armor for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86535/plate-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plate Specialization</span></a>, making whichever highest item level plate armor you have the best choice in 90% of cases, regardless of secondary stats.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Agility</b> no longer gives benefits to strength-based classes so even your choice of jewelry is restricted.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Defense</b> rating has been removed from the game in favor of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=29594/bastion-of-defense">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_defend.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bastion of Defense</span></a> providing passive immunity to critical strikes.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Block rating</b> and <b>Block value</b> have also been removed from the game and bundled into <b>Mastery</b> to boost the effect of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=76857/critical-block">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_criticalblock.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Critical Block</span></a>, making mastery the best secondary stat for a <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> by a long shot. <ins>We will look for mastery on every item, or reforge to mastery when they don't have any.</ins></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The increase of the threat modifier in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=71/defensive-stance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_defensivestance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defensive Stance</span></a> from +100% to +500% threat, paired with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=93098/vengeance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_shieldofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vengeance</span></a> tripling your attack power, have made offensive stats such as <b>Expertise</b> and <b>Hit</b> ratings redundant since you now don't need to worry about your threat generation.</div></li></ul>Overall, many stats that contributed to the depth of building a good gear set, balancing survivability and threat to your needs, have been stripped from the game or made irrelevant. The game within the game of finessing your ratings to hit defense, expertise, and hit caps is gone in favor of <i>"more item level = more better"</i>, and reforging everything to mastery is the no-brainer strategy we will use until the second half of the expansion.<div class="box" data-level="null" style="display: block;">
<ul class="first">
<li class="fa fa-check">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Our new goals for gearing in <b>Cataclysm</b> are:</b>
<ol class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Use the highest item level items in every slot to increase our <b>Strength</b>, <b>Stamina</b> and <b>Armor</b> for maximum Effective Health and threat in the form of Attack Power and a higher <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=93098/vengeance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_shieldofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vengeance</span></a> ceiling.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Prefer items with <b>Mastery</b> as a secondary stat, or reforge to mastery whenever possible, until full <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-stat-priority-attributes-pve#survival">Combat Table Coverage</a> is achieved.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Maintain a good balance between <b>Dodge</b> and <b>Parry</b> ratings now that they share similar diminishing returns <i>(with a slight 8% skew in favor of parry rating due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=84621/hold-the-line">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_bg_defendxtowers_av.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hold the Line</span></a>)</i>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Expertise</b> and <b>Hit</b> ratings are not mandatory since threat is rarely a concern, and any secondary stat that isn't contributing to the Combat Table Coverage is detrimental to our survivability.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Ignore <b>Critical strike</b> and <b>Haste</b> ratings that have low value for TPS/<wbr/>DPS.</div></li></ol></div></li></ul>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<a class="cta-button" data-border="strong" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-stat-priority-attributes-pve">Protection Warrior Stat Priority and Attributes</a></div></div>
