<ul class="last">
<li class="fa fa-arrow-right">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<i>Theoretically, you could get the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60329/earthen-chestguard">
