<img alt="Earthen Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Handguards</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60330/earthen-legguards">
<img alt="Earthen Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Legguards</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58187/ring-of-the-battle-anthem">
<img alt="Ring of the Battle Anthem" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_82.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Battle Anthem</span></a> without ever setting foot inside a raid. However, it would take weeks of daily heroics to garner the required <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, so I don't think it is realistic or relevant to add all these items to the <ins>pre-raid</ins> gear set.</i></div></li></ul>
<div class="clear"></div></div></div></div>
<hr/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Protection Warrior Tank</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-protection-warrior-tank">Head for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>
<a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a>
<span class="c1">s</span> proficient in <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> (525) will be able to craft the ilvl 359 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59359/reinforced-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reinforced Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> before setting foot in raids and customize it with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59480">cogwheels</a> for the perfect stats. This helmet is equal to the best 359 helmet available in T11 raids and will only be replaced by heroic 372 pieces.<br/>
<br/>The best alternative for non-Engineers comes from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> with the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58103/helm-of-the-proud">
<img alt="Helm of the Proud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplage_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of the Proud</span></a>. Although it comes with no mastery, the great socket bonus and balance of secondary stats to reforge into mastery give it a small edge over the other ilvl 346 helmets.<br/>
<ins>That being said</ins>, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56278/anomuran-helm">
<img alt="Anomuran Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anomuran Helm</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57873/helm-of-setesh">
<img alt="Helm of Setesh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Setesh</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62428/crown-of-wings">
<img alt="Crown of Wings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplage_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Wings</span></a> are all almost as good, only losing out to the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58103/helm-of-the-proud">
<img alt="Helm of the Proud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_dungeonplage_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of the Proud</span></a> by a small margin because of less favorable gem sockets, so you may want to save your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> to upgrade more urgent slots first.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62366/arcanum-of-the-earthen-ring">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Earthen Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Earthen Ring</span></a>
