<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-protection-warrior-tank">Shoulders for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The epic <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67144/pauldrons-of-edward-the-odd">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Edward the Odd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Edward the Odd</span></a> are naturally the best pre-raid shoulders as the only ilvl 359 item available, but since they are a World Drop BoE they will most likely be rare and expensive. <br/>A more reliable pair of shoulders to farm before stepping into T11 raids are the 346 <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56452/earthshape-pauldrons">
<img alt="Earthshape Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthshape Pauldrons</span></a>, with a perfect stats distribution for a tank. Other 346 shoulders <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56318/razs-pauldrons">
<img alt="Raz's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raz's Pauldrons</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63470/missing-diplomats-pauldrons">
<img alt="Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Missing Diplomat's Pauldrons</span></a> are good alternatives with baseline mastery, albeit with a less valuable secondary stat to reforge.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Inscription</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62333/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a>
