<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-protection-warrior-tank">Back for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a> is the best cloak for Phase 1 of Cataclysm, including raid drops, and it's a guaranteed reward once you reach an Exalted reputation with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>. It's easy to get and comes with perfect stats for a tank so it's a real no-brainer. <br/>That being said, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56549/twilight-dragonscale-cloak">
<img alt="Twilight Dragonscale Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_b_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Dragonscale Cloak</span></a> is almost its equal and a great alternative, with marginally less mitigation but more EHP thanks to its gem socket totalling 41 more stamina than the epic. If you have the gold to craft this cloak, you could delay grinding your <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a> reputation to last.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74234/enchant-cloak-protection">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Protection</span></a>
