<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-protection-warrior-tank">Wrist for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57870/alpha-bracers">
<img alt="Alpha Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alpha Bracers</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67238/terboruss-rotating-bands">
<img alt="Terborus's Rotating Bands" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terborus's Rotating Bands</span></a> (BoE), and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62449/sandguard-bracers">
<img alt="Sandguard Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandguard Bracers</span></a> are all excellent bracers within touching distance of each other. Although you would expect the ilvl 359 epic to be the best pick of the bunch, the lack of baseline mastery and gem socket reduces their appeal by a lot. As a result, I would recommend chasing the blues higher up in the list and leaving the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a> reputation grind for last since there is nothing else we want from this reputation.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85007/draconic-embossment-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Stamina</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>), <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62256/enchant-bracer-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Stamina</span></a>
