<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-protection-warrior-tank">Hands for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>Depending on how quickly you reach lvl 85 to start running <span class="icon-heroic"></span> <b>Heroic Dungeons</b>, you should be able to garner enough <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> for at least one piece of the <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=943">ilvl 359 T11 set</a> before raids become available in Phase 1. My recommendation is to go for the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60332/earthen-handguards">
<img alt="Earthen Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthen Handguards</span></a> immediately as they are the best gloves for Phase 1 in both their ilvl 359 and ilvl 372 versions, and also the biggest upgrade over the ilvl 346 alternatives.<br/>
<br/>In the meantime, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58105/numbing-handguards">
<img alt="Numbing Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Numbing Handguards</span></a> and the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56428/fingers-of-light">
<img alt="Fingers of Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Light</span></a> are your best options, with excellent tank stats. They are basically identical so save your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> unless you are unlucky with drops.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a>
