<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-protection-warrior-tank">Feet for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62432/gryphon-riders-boots">
<img alt="Gryphon Rider's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gryphon Rider's Boots</span></a> are the best boots by a long shot, as the only 359 epic available outside of raids, plus a perfect itemization for tanks, minus the sucky gem socket. They are better than all the boots alternatives in normal T11 raids and only replaced by 372 items. The main downside is that you will need to reach Exalted with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a> to purchase them, and it's basically the only item you care about from this reputation.<br/>In the meantime, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63444/baron-silverlaines-greaves">
<img alt="Baron Silverlaine's Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Baron Silverlaine's Greaves</span></a> are your only alternative and they're not even close. The rest of the 346 boots are pretty bad, with double DPS secondary stats.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>
