<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Protection Warrior Tank</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-protection-warrior-tank">Neck for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>Despite the lack of baseline mastery, the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=755/jewelcrafting">
<img alt="Jewelcrafting" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jewelcrafting</span></a> craft <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52323/elementium-guardian">
<img alt="Elementium Guardian" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Guardian</span></a> is the best pre-raid necklace by a small margin thanks to its additional gem socket at seemingly no cost to the total item budget of the piece. <br/>However, if you don't feel like paying for such a small upgrade, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56319/carrier-wave-pendant">
<img alt="Carrier Wave Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carrier Wave Pendant</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57932/the-lustrous-eye">
<img alt="The Lustrous Eye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Lustrous Eye</span></a> are almost as good. They are also identical so you can save some <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> if you loot the former, or just decide to buy the JP neck right as you hit lvl 85 and never set foot in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a> <span class="icon-heroic"></span> since you don't need any other drop from this dungeon.<br/>The World Drop BoE <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67138/buc-zakai-choker">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Choker</span></a> is a great alternative, but not as good as the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52323/elementium-guardian">
<img alt="Elementium Guardian" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_32.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Guardian</span></a> and likely to be more expensive since it is coveted by damage dealers.<div class="pad"></div>
