<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-protection-warrior-tank">Main Hand Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>
<ul>
<li class="fa fa-arrow-right">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<i>While your choice of weapon was possibly the most intricate part of gearing a tank in previous expansions, with different speeds for different usage and preferred weapon types based on your talents, or race and unique weapon proficiencies, all of these nuances go out of the window with the new expansion. <b>In Cataclysm</b>, 99% of main-hands with strength are the same 2.60 speed tank-oriented weapons and the bonus expertise from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20597/sword-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_meleedamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sword Specialization</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20574/axe-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe Specialization</span></a> barely amount to a 1-2% TPS difference that we will mostly ignore to focus on better survivability since threat is no longer a concern.</i></div></li></ul>The best pre-raid weapon in Phase 1 is the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56346/elementium-fang">
<img alt="Elementium Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Fang</span></a>, regardless of race and weapon proficiencies, because it's the only 346 weapon that comes with mastery and avoidance as secondary stats to improve your CTC.<br/>A very close contender, if you find yourself with spare time for more <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> digging instead of running heroic dungeons, is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64885/scimitar-of-the-sirocco">
<img alt="Scimitar of the Sirocco" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_scimitar-of-the-sirocco.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scimitar of the Sirocco</span></a>. Despite being an ilvl 359 epic, it's barely on par with the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56346/elementium-fang">
<img alt="Elementium Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Fang</span></a> thanks to it's higher stamina because of the mediocre DPS-oriented secondary stats. However, the higher damage range amounts to roughly a ~1.4% TPS upgrade in exchange for ~0.5% less survivability compared to <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56346/elementium-fang">
<img alt="Elementium Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Fang</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65171/cookies-tenderizer">
<img alt="Cookie's Tenderizer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_fabric_silk_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cookie's Tenderizer</span></a> is a funny weapon, as one of only 3 main-hands slower than 2.60 speed throughout Cataclysm. Due to its slightly better scaling with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=772/rend">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_gouge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rend</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=12867/deep-wounds">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_backstab.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Wounds</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20243/devastate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Devastate</span></a> all affected by your weapon's damage range, it increases your TPS by ~1.5% in exchange for ~0.7% less survivability compared to <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56346/elementium-fang">
<img alt="Elementium Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Fang</span></a>. <br/>The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56364/axe-of-the-eclipse">
<img alt="Axe of the Eclipse" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe of the Eclipse</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68739/darkheart-hacker">
<img alt="Darkheart Hacker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkheart Hacker</span></a> are good third choices, with the highest amount of mastery among the 346 weapons available. <i>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="race" data-game="wow" data-type="race" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/race=2/orc">
<img alt="Orc" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/race_orc_male.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Orc</span></a>s can gain a ~2% TPS increase thanks to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=20574/axe-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Axe Specialization</span></a> in exchange for ~1% less survivability than <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56346/elementium-fang">
<img alt="Elementium Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Fang</span></a>.</i>
<br/>
<br/>Overall, the performance delta between any of the 6 ilvl346 weapons with mastery listed below is <b>very small</b>, <i>smaller than most armor slots in fact</i>, and any of them will be good enough to step into your first raid with so don't stress farming the best of the best too much.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74244/enchant-weapon-windwalk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Windwalk</span></a>
