<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shields-for-protection-warrior-tank">Shields for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>If you grinded <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> during the pre-patch and unlocked the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69764/extinct-turtle-shell">
<img alt="Extinct Turtle Shell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Extinct Turtle Shell</span></a>, you already own the best pre-raid shield and are set until heroic raid drops. Congratulations! If not, what have you been doing this past month?!<br/>
<br/>If you haven't been so lucky, your alternative is dropping a fat stack of gold on the World Drop BoE <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67145/blockades-lost-shield">
<img alt="Blockade's Lost Shield" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_grimbatolraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blockade's Lost Shield</span></a> with identical stats to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69764/extinct-turtle-shell">
<img alt="Extinct Turtle Shell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Extinct Turtle Shell</span></a> <i>(but a much cooler look than a freaking lvl 16 turtle carapace shield)</i>, or crafting the equally expensive but equally stylish <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55069/elementium-earthguard">
<img alt="Elementium Earthguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_grimbatolraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Earthguard</span></a>. <br/>As a 4th option, but clearly not as good, you can get the acceptable <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57926/shield-of-the-four-grey-towers">
<img alt="Shield of the Four Grey Towers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shield of the Four Grey Towers</span></a> for just 950 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> if you're a cheapskate like me, or the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56314/shield-of-the-iron-maiden">
<img alt="Shield of the Iron Maiden" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_cataclysm_c_01-.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shield of the Iron Maiden</span></a> that makes up for his inferior stats with the coolest name of the bunch.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended Shield Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74226/enchant-shield-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Shield - Mastery</span></a>
