<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="ranged-weapons-for-protection-warrior-tank">Ranged Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56376/thundercall">
<img alt="Thundercall" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_firearm_2h_rifle_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thundercall</span></a> is the only ranged weapon with tank stats you will find between ilvl 308 and 346.<br/>However, the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> craft <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59367/kickback-5000">
<img alt="Kickback 5000" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kickback 5000</span></a> is a decent alternative despite worthless agility in place of strength thanks to its additional socket bonus at seemingly no cost to its item budget. On minor slots like these, the value of an extra gem adds more than 40% stamina to the item.<ul>
<li class="fa fa-warning">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<i>Do not vendor your <img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/> <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63739/silenced-blunderbuss">
<img alt="Silenced Blunderbuss" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_firearm_2h_rifle_cataclysm_b_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Silenced Blunderbuss</span></a>/<wbr/>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/> <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63736/muffled-blunderbuss">
<img alt="Muffled Blunderbuss" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_firearm_2h_rifle_cataclysm_b_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Muffled Blunderbuss</span></a> as they are the only ranged weapons for a DPS <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> pre-raid.</i></div></li></ul>
<b>Recommended BiS Scope</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59595/r19-threatfinder">
<img alt="R19 Threatfinder" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_scopec.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">R19 Threatfinder</span></a>
